# Experiment weights: ignore new files under bot/weights, keep only the
# production net. Uses `/*` (not `/`) so the exception can re-include a child.
# Historical nets already committed stay tracked; this only stops scratch
# checkpoints, intermediates and losing candidates from piling up as untracked.
bot/weights/*
!bot/weights/anneal14-Rcq.bin
# Base point for the residual/manual tuple-discovery fine-tuning runs on the
# Python compute server (frozen base + 37 hand-picked tuples, arm trained).
!bot/weights/anneal14-manual-frozen.bin

